{
  "$comment": "canonicalJson with the semantics of modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk PR #3209 (packages/core-internal/src/ext/events/canonicalJson.ts at f3bdeab0): one JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(x)) pass, then object keys sorted by UTF-16 code unit at every depth; numbers and strings exactly as JSON.stringify writes them. Every `canonical` value was produced by running #3209's canonicalJson on `input` (parsed with JSON.parse). Not RFC 8785.",
  "source": "modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk#3209@f3bdeab016db4c234c1c2e1ba5a8f07ddcd2ecf4",
  "cases": [
    { "case": "empty-object", "input": {}, "canonical": "{}" },
